{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And you shall set apart.</b> You shall set apart for the name, so that it not intermingle with another. Now these are two commandments commanded on the fifteenth day." "<b>Offspring.</b> On the pattern of אֶרֶץ, in that it does not change in the construct state. But foreign words have been found, and these are they: שְׁגַר אלפיך (Deuteronomy 7:13), ובחֲדַר משכבך (above 7:28), הֲבל הבלים (Ecclesiastes 1:2), מספח חֲמָתְךְ (Habakkuk 2:15), and סגור דְלְתךָ (Isaiah 26:20). I have not found more."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:08.635158602Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}